A||||14||Sleeper||Big Los Angeles Sportscar Cruise(pics)||||14||
Z||000000||Sleeper||07-31-2001||08:40 PM||||Chris and Eric at West Coast invited me to this sportscar run that was on Sunday. it was 180 mile run with 4 stops in between going up through the mountains into the desert and then coming around and back down through the mountains and let me tell you it was HUGE, over 500 cars doing a canyon run, you knew something was going to happen...(here R sum pics)  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/focus.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rx7.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/skyline.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/supra2.jpg"> ||||reg||14
Z||000001||Sleeper||07-31-2001||08:44 PM||||there ended up being only 3 fieros, Chris's, Steve's(works at west coast) and mine but it was so cool to be in a crowd like this and hang with the big boys.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/silver2_1.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/viper2.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/yellow.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/silver3_1.jpg">  <P><p>[This message has been edited by Sleeper (edited 07-31-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||Sleeper||07-31-2001||08:49 PM||||here are some of the stops and the last one is the parking lot where we started.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cobraandZ.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/longshot.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/longshot2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/parkinglot.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Sleeper||07-31-2001||09:03 PM||||like i said anything can happen with over 500 cars. countless breakdowns occured and a eclipes found its self down in a ditch. a WRX and Cobra R stang went into a guardrail up in the hills.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wreck6.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wreck1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wreck2.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wreck4.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wreck5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Formula||07-31-2001||09:16 PM||||I saw the cobra-r and wrx wrecked on the ls1 forum already.  that would suck.. they need to have a big cruise like that around here!||||reg||1
